568			where the $\approx_{\delta_{\mathrm{qld}}}$ statements hold with respect to the state $\ket{\mathrm{aux}}_{\mathrm{A'B'}} \ot \ket{\mathrm{EPR}_2}^{\ot M \log q}_{\mathrm{A''B''}}$ and the answer summation is over $u \in \F_q^M$. Here $\sigma^W_u$ denotes the tensor product of single-qubit Pauli measurements
569			\[
570				\bigotimes_{i=1}^{M} \bigotimes_{j=1}^{\log q} \sigma^W_{u_{ij}}\;,
571			\]
572			where $\kappa(u_i) = (u_{ij})_{1 \le j \le \log q}$ under the bijection $\kappa\colon \F_q \to \F_2^{\log q}$ of Chapter~\ref{chap:qpbt-algebra}.
