   5	
   6	This module records the prefix decomposition of a conditionally linear map and
   7	the behavior of such maps and their shared-seed distributions under finite
   8	coordinate direct sums.  The direct-sum construction on representations that
   9	these results build on is in
  10	`MIPStarRE/QPBT/Games/CondLinearTheorems/DirectSumSupport.lean`.
  11	
  12	## References
  13	
