  15	(`blueprint/src/chapter/ch12_qpbt_games.tex:1206-1226`), `lem:cl-func-prod`
  16	(`ch12_qpbt_games.tex:1255-1266`), and `lem:cl-dist-prod`
  17	(`ch12_qpbt_games.tex:1273-1278`), with paper origin
  18	`references/qpbt-paper/05_conditionally_linear_functions.tex:150-379`.
